      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This paper describes a project that sought to improve the management of children's pain in an A&E department. Pain management is not always seen as a priority in A&E departments. The problems are highlighted through two case studies, and guidelines to improve practice were developed in collaboration with a specialist multidisciplinary team."},
